    "title": "Is Rocky Carroll leaving 'NCIS'? Shocking 500th episode, explained",
    "text": "TELEVISIONCincy actor has character killed off hit CBS show after 18 seasonsHaadiza Ogwude Bryan AlexanderCincinnati EnquirerUpdated March 25, 2026, 3:58 p.m. ETSpoiler alert! This article contains spoilers for the 500th episode of \"NCIS.\"Director Leon Vance has permanently left the \"NCIS\" building.The CBS crime drama's 500th episode, which aired March 24, shocked fans by killing long-running NCIS agent Vance, played by Cincinnati native Rocky Carroll. The \"Chicago Hope\" actor starred in the show for 18 seasons and 392 episodes, USA TODAY reports.",
